<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 23 October <span class="n">5</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/marcus-junius-brutus"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/marcus-junius-brutus.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Marcus Junius Brutus</span><span class="tp">85–42 BCE</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ibrahim-ii-of-ifriqiya"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ibrahim-ii-of-ifriqiya.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ibrahim II of Ifriqiya</span><span class="tp">850–902</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/john-of-capistrano"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/john-of-capistrano.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">John of Capistrano</span><span class="tp">1386–1456</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/chulalongkorn"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/chulalongkorn.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Chulalongkorn</span><span class="tp">1853–1910</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/john-boyd-dunlop"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/john-boyd-dunlop.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">John Boyd Dunlop</span><span class="tp">1840–1921</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
